  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Landscapes Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since early 2015, IDH has been convening, facilitating dialogues, and planning co-funding of worthwhile initiatives with key stakeholders. We have brought together and built a public private coalition with key public and private sector actors including the flower companies, farmers&#x2019; unions, Central Rift Lakes Basin Authority and other government stakeholders and NGOs. Based on studies and bilateral consultations with these stakeholder, we have been piloting joint activities fostering sustainable land and water management.</narrative>
  </description>
